          "708013002": {
            "id": "708013002",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Swan",
            "text": "As I'm sure you are completely aware, the affairs of the Knights of Favonius within the city walls are currently under the management of Ms. Jean. My question, then, is: What is Ms. Jean's official title?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
